1
00:00:00,268 --> 00:00:05,480
This child has muscle wasting and mosaic
variegated aneuploidy, a condition in which

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:08,000
cells can carry different numbers of
chromosomes.

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:12,200
Our question is whether an existing medicine
could improve muscle function while

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,800
preserving the cells needed for growth and
repair.

5
00:00:15,049 --> 00:00:17,840
We propose two medicines for laboratory
testing.

6
00:00:18,398 --> 00:00:24,000
Our genetic hypothesis involves BUB1B, which
makes the chromosome-checking protein

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,160
BUBR1.

8
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,640
One variant creates an early stop.

9
00:00:27,915 --> 00:00:30,040
The other changes one amino acid.

10
00:00:30,401 --> 00:00:35,080
They must occupy opposite gene copies for this
compound-heterozygous explanation.

11
00:00:35,361 --> 00:00:39,960
Confirmed cis means both share one copy and
retires that explanation.

12
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,000
The missense variant's function remains
unproved.

13
00:00:43,559 --> 00:00:48,000
Everolimus inhibits mTORC1, which regulates
cell growth.

14
00:00:48,192 --> 00:00:50,960
Its established target makes it practical to
test.

15
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:55,640
The supporting mouse blot shows stronger
phosphoprotein bands in two single-allele

16
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,520
carriers than two controls.

17
00:00:57,796 --> 00:01:02,400
Without matching total-protein measurements,
quantification or statistical tests,

18
00:01:02,528 --> 00:01:05,120
increased pathway activity is unproved.

19
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:08,800
Harmful excess and useful muscle benefit still
need testing.

20
00:01:09,358 --> 00:01:13,000
Our challenger is niacin, the nicotinic acid
medicine.

21
00:01:13,189 --> 00:01:17,080
It increased muscle NAD in a small study of
another disease.

22
00:01:17,345 --> 00:01:23,400
Separate experiments connect NAD and the
enzyme SIRT2 to BUBR1 stability.

23
00:01:23,662 --> 00:01:27,920
The missing link is whether niacin restores
useful protein and muscle function in this

24
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:28,760
genotype.

25
00:01:28,957 --> 00:01:30,680
We test the medicines separately.

26
00:01:31,234 --> 00:01:34,880
Our completed computer model shows why
percentages can mislead.

27
00:01:35,231 --> 00:01:39,880
In one assumed scenario, removing abnormal
cells improved the chromosome-normal

28
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:43,360
fraction while reducing total muscle-cell
output over time.

29
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:46,480
These are simulated results, not drug effects.

30
00:01:46,863 --> 00:01:51,560
Our experiment therefore follows each starting
cell, including those that die or stop

31
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,240
dividing.

32
00:01:52,736 --> 00:01:57,280
We would compare affected and genetically
corrected muscle models, using measured drug

33
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,200
exposures.

34
00:01:58,559 --> 00:02:03,440
A medicine must improve either existing muscle
or new muscle production, preserve the

35
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:06,360
other, and avoid worsening chromosome errors.

36
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:09,560
Independent confirmation must reproduce the
result.

37
00:02:09,834 --> 00:02:13,920
The cancer history also requires checking that
neither medicine helps tumor cells

38
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:16,600
survive or interferes with cancer treatment.

39
00:02:17,154 --> 00:02:21,680
Arimoclomol remains a reserve because rescue
of this protein is unproved.

40
00:02:22,017 --> 00:02:27,160
Removing senescent cells has strong genetic
mouse evidence, but some drugs also damage

41
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,560
repair in young muscle.

42
00:02:28,672 --> 00:02:30,960
We investigate that mechanism in parallel.

43
00:02:31,148 --> 00:02:35,760
Transcript rescue and other alternatives have
explicit promotion tests in our report.

44
00:02:36,298 --> 00:02:41,480
We have completed sequence review, evidence
review and computational study design.

45
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:44,280
No biological drug experiment has run.

46
00:02:44,523 --> 00:02:47,800
We seek a consented cell model and laboratory
partner.

47
00:02:48,149 --> 00:02:52,560
The deliverable is a reproducible decision:
advance a medicine with measured

48
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:55,640
functional benefit, or explain why none
passes.

49
00:02:55,953 --> 00:02:59,720
The method can then be tested in other
chromosome-instability disorders.
